# CrimeLens AI — Environment Variables
# ======================================
# The app connects to the Catalyst Serverless Function (geminiProxy).
# The Gemini API key (GEMINI_API_KEY) is stored securely in Catalyst Function environment settings.
#
# Optional Local Override:
# VITE_CATALYST_PROXY_URL=/server/geminiProxy
# VITE_USE_OFFLINE_ONLY=false
